Within the final_deliverable folder, the structure and purpose of the documents are explained as follows: 

final_deliverable/
├─ .streamlit/
│  ├─ config.toml        # Streamlit theme/layout settings
│  └─ secrets.toml       # Local-only credentials (Azure keys, blob paths)
│
├─ .gitignore            # Git ignore rules (env files, large data, etc.)
├─ app.py                # Main Streamlit entry point and tab router - run this file to run the applciation
│
├─ intro_tab.py          # Intro/overview tab
├─ dashboard_tab.py      # KPI dashboard & visualizations
├─ network_tab.py        # Network analysis & influence scoring tab
├─ attribution_tab.py    # Attribution modeling (Markov-chain) tab
│
├─ penta_logo.png        # Branding image used in the UI
└─ structure.py          # Utility module defining directory paths and schema